<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Dra. Luiza — Mães em Foco</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--b:#7B5EA7;--bl:#EDE8F5;--bm:#C4B0E0;--bd:#5A3F85;--bg:#F7F5FB;--w:#fff;--t:#1E1533;--mu:#7A7189;--r:16px;--sh:0 4px 24px rgba(123,94,167,.12)}
body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--t)}
/* NAV */
nav{background:var(--w);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 5%;height:64px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(123,94,167,.1)}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none}
.logo-icon{width:38px;height:38px;background:var(--bl);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px}
.logo-text{font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--b)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--t);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;transition:color .2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--b)}
.nav-links a.arr::after{content:' ▾';font-size:10px;opacity:.5}
.btn-in{background:var(--b);color:var(--w)!important;padding:8px 22px;border-radius:24px;font-weight:600!important}
.btn-in:hover{background:var(--bd)!important}
/* LAYOUT */
main{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
.back{font-size:13px;color:var(--mu);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.back:hover{color:var(--b)}
/* CARD */
.card{background:var(--w);border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:var(--sh);padding:28px;animation:up .5s ease both}
@keyframes up{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
/* PROFILE */
.ph{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}
.av-wrap{position:relative;flex-shrink:0}
.av{width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c4b0e0,#7B5EA7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;border:3px solid var(--bl)}
.badge{position:absolute;bottom:2px;right:2px;width:22px;height:22px;background:var(--b);border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--w);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:11px}
.pname{font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:22px}
.rrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:6px 0 4px}
.stars{color:#F4A261;font-size:15px}
.rval{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
.rcount,.rdate,.rtext{font-size:13px;color:var(--mu)}
.rtext{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.spec{font-size:14px;color:var(--b);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:10px}
.socials{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:4px}
.sicon{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bl);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .15s}
.sicon:hover{background:var(--bm);transform:scale(1.1)}
.bio{margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--mu);border-top:1px solid var(--bl);padding-top:16px}
/* BUTTONS */
.btn-wa,.btn-more{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:14px;background:var(--b);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;margin-top:20px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .15s,box-shadow .2s}
.btn-wa:hover{background:var(--bd);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(123,94,167,.35)}
.btn-more{background:transparent;border:1.5px solid var(--bl);color:var(--b);margin-top:8px;padding:12px}
.btn-more:hover{background:var(--bl);border-color:var(--b)}
/* ADDRESS */
.label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--mu);margin-bottom:10px}
.arow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px}
.atext{font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}
.mlink{font-size:13px;color:var(--b);font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
.mlink:hover{text-decoration:underline}
/* GALLERY */
.gwrap{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px}
.gtrack{display:flex;gap:12px;transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.gimg{min-width:calc(50% - 6px);height:160px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bl);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:40px}
.gbtn{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--w);border:none;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:var(--sh);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;color:var(--b);z-index:5}
.gbtn:hover{background:var(--bl)}
.gbtn.prev{left:8px}.gbtn.next{right:8px}
/* REVIEWS */
.rhead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
.bignum{font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:52px;line-height:1}
.bigstars{color:#F4A261;font-size:18px}
.tvox{font-size:12px;color:var(--mu);background:#f0f4ff;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.tab{padding:6px 16px;border-radius:20px;border:1.5px solid var(--bl);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:var(--t);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;transition:all .2s}
.tab:hover{border-color:var(--b);color:var(--b)}
.tab.active{background:var(--b);border-color:var(--b);color:#fff}
.ri{border-top:1px solid var(--bl);padding:18px 0}
.rirow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px}
.rileft{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.rav{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bl);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--b)}
.rname{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
@media(max-width:520px){.nav-links{gap:16px}.ph{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center}.socials{justify-content:center}.arow{flex-direction:column}.bignum{font-size:40px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="logo">
    <div class="logo-icon">🌿</div>
    <div class="logo-text">mães<br>em foco</div>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#" class="arr">Serviços</a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="arr">Mapa</a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="arr">Sobre</a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="arr">Feed</a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="btn-in">Entrar</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>
<main>
  <a href="#" class="back">← Voltar</a>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="ph">
      <div class="av-wrap">
        <div class="av">👩🏾‍⚕️</div>
        <div class="badge">✓</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="pname">Dra. Luiza</div>
        <div class="rrow"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span class="rval">5.0</span><span class="rcount">(22 avaliações)</span></div>
        <div class="spec">Psicóloga</div>
        <div class="socials">
          <a href="#" class="sicon">✉️</a>
          <a href="#" class="sicon">🔗</a>
          <a href="#" class="sicon">📸</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="bio">Apoio especializado para mães solo e seus filhos, focado em segurança emocional e bem-estar. Um espaço acolhedor com intervenções lúdicas, como desenhos e pinturas, para fortalecer o vínculo e o desenvolvimento infantil. 🎨🌸</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/5531999999999" class="btn-wa" target="_blank">💬 Entrar em contato pelo Whatsapp</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="label">Endereço</div>
    <div class="arow">
      <div class="atext">Av. dos Andradas, 2200 – Centro<br>Belo Horizonte – MG, 30120-010</div>
      <a href="https://maps.google.com" class="mlink" target="_blank">Ver no Google Maps 📍</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="label">Conheça meu espaço</div>
    <div class="gwrap">
      <button class="gbtn prev" onclick="slide(-1)">‹</button>
      <div class="gtrack" id="gt">
        <div class="gimg">🪑</div><div class="gimg">🖼️</div>
        <div class="gimg">🛋️</div><div class="gimg">🌿</div>
      </div>
      <button class="gbtn next" onclick="slide(1)">›</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="rhead">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px">
        <div class="bignum">5.0</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding-bottom:6px">
          <div class="bigstars">★★★★★</div>
          <div class="rcount">22 avaliações</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tvox">🏅 trustvox</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs">
      <button class="tab" onclick="setTab(this)">Relevantes</button>
      <button class="tab active" onclick="setTab(this)">Recentes</button>
      <button class="tab" onclick="setTab(this)">Melhores Avaliações</button>
      <button class="tab" onclick="setTab(this)">Piores Avaliações</button>
    </div>
    <div id="reviews">
      <div class="ri">
        <div class="rirow"><div class="rileft"><div class="rav">M</div><div><div class="rname">Mariana</div><div class="rdate">13 de fevereiro de 2026 · 22h20</div></div></div><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="rtext">Uma profissional muito simpática e acolhedora! Seu ambiente é fantástico, com uma sala exclusiva para crianças.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ri">
        <div class="rirow"><div class="rileft"><div class="rav">C</div><div><div class="rname">Camila</div><div class="rdate">5 de janeiro de 2026 · 14h10</div></div></div><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="rtext">Experiência incrível desde o primeiro contato. A Dra. Luiza é extremamente atenciosa e faz meu filho se sentir confortável.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="btn-more" id="btnMore" onclick="loadMore()">Ver Mais Avaliações +</button>
  </div>
</main>
<script>
let cur=0,gt=document.getElementById('gt');
function slide(d){cur=Math.max(0,Math.min(gt.children.length-2,cur+d));gt.style.transform=`translateX(-${cur*(gt.children[0].offsetWidth+12)}px)`}
function setTab(el){document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>t.classList.remove('active'));el.classList.add('active')}
const extras=[
  {n:'Fernanda',d:'20 de dezembro de 2025 · 09h45',t:'Recomendo muito! Profissional dedicada que se importa com o desenvolvimento das crianças e o bem-estar das mães.'},
  {n:'Renata',d:'8 de novembro de 2025 · 16h30',t:'A sala é linda e muito bem equipada para crianças. Meu filho ama as sessões e sempre sai feliz!'}
];
function loadMore(){
  const btn=document.getElementById('btnMore'),box=document.getElementById('reviews');
  extras.forEach(r=>{
    box.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="ri" style="animation:up .4s ease both"><div class="rirow"><div class="rileft"><div class="rav">${r.n[0]}</div><div><div class="rname">${r.n}</div><div class="rdate">${r.d}</div></div></div><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div><div class="rtext">${r.t}</div></div>`);
  });
  btn.style.display='none';
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
